// Named places: the old LocationFactory and CaveLocationFactory sites and the six stages of the
// mountain crossing, ported by the tmp harness p4a/dump (old factories run and read back), with the
// handful of creation-time dice (old Utils.DetermineSuccess / RandInt) written as "chance" and "stories".
// Loaded once by Content; ContentTests checks every name in here resolves.
//
// placement: Named sites are dealt onto open land by MapGen (weight within the tile's terrain; elite
// ones only far from camp); Cave sites onto cave floors; Pass stages along the eastern corridor in order.
// hazard/wind/cover/visibility/temperatureDeltaF/traversal replace the terrain's own values on that tile.
// features: forage, trees and stock become the tile's pools (forage always first: pool 0 is a tile's
// forage). water, smallGame, shelter, cache and event are carried for systems that do not exist yet.
// chance: the odds generation puts the feature there. revealAtHours: 0 is in plain sight.
